 fits 38 notes in the list, but others monitors could fit more or less)\n- Start the game with embeded mode enabled\n- Pause the game\n- change input mode from **Input** to **2D**\n- Alt+RightClick anywhere, a long popup menu with all nodes in mouse's position will appear, if the list of nodes is long enough it will have a scrollbar\n- Try to make the scrollbar work with the mouse wheel, it will not work\n\nI discovered once an item is hovered you can use arrow keys to move down and show more items bellow\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21323980/test-bug.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108764/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108764/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}